<div class="accordion">
    <div class="accordion-item active"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('What is Rocket League Win Boosting?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content" style="display:block;"><p><?= t('Rocket League Win Boosting delivers a selected number of wins at your current competitive rank. Choose the playlist, platform, amount of games, and available extras before placing the order.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Which Rocket League ranks are supported?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Win Boosting is available from Bronze through the high Champion and Grand Champion levels, subject to current booster availability and the selected playlist.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Which playlists can I choose?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Available queues can include Duel, Doubles, Standard, and supported extra modes. Always select the exact playlist in the form because rank and matchmaking progress are separate for each queue.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Can I play together with the booster?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Choose Duo when it is available to play from your own account alongside the booster. Solo orders are completed directly on the account by the assigned player.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Which platforms support Rocket League Win Boosting?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Select PC, PlayStation, or Xbox when offered in the form. Correct platform information helps us assign a compatible booster and prevents delays.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Can I stream or prioritize the order?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Stream Games lets you watch eligible Solo sessions, while Priority gives the order faster assignment and handling. The available extras and their prices appear in the summary.') ?></p></div></div>
</div>
